OverscriptBox[g, .] = off - I(eff . g - g . eff^\\[Dagger]) + \
\\[CapitalSigma]\\[Mu] bob\\[Mu] . g . bob\\[Mu], associated with the \
Hamiltonian ham (either n*n matrix or WickHermitian) and a set of quantum \
jump operators jmp (WickJump).", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> 
